          "combined_score": 0.9975,
          "sql": "-- Clean: the group churn rate uses only labels old enough that their outcome window had already closed at the prediction time (the label horizon is 14 days).\nSELECT sp.user_id, sp.label_ts, sp.churned,\n       (SELECT AVG(h.churned)\n        FROM labels AS h\n        JOIN entities AS he ON he.user_id = h.user_id\n        WHERE he.country = u.country\n          AND h.label_ts <= sp.label_ts - INTERVAL '21 days') AS country_churn_rate\nFROM labels AS sp\nJOIN entities AS u ON u.user_id = sp.user_id"
